  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**2(2)/(3)+1(4)/(3)×1(6)/(7)÷5(1)/(2)**\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nBODMAS\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/42bb4721cca13c7a34266d1bfbf6127eca9333c261e2e7b7a1cf02e43d5d169d.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n**2(2)/(3)+1(4)/(3)×1(6)/(7)÷5(1)/(2) **\n\n⇒ (8)/(3)+(7)/(3)×(13)/(7)÷(11)/(2) \n\n⇒ (8)/(3) + (7)/(3)×(13)/(7)×(2)/(11) \n\n⇒ (8)/(3)+(26)/(33)\n\n⇒ (114)/(33)= (38)/(11) \n\n⇒ 3(5)/(11)\n\n**∴ The simplified value is 3(5)/(11)**.\n\n76",
